1
00:00:00,021 --> 00:00:01,525
(This drama complied with production
guidelines for filming child actors,)

2
00:00:01,527 --> 00:00:03,000
(and some scenes used
generative AI technology.)

3
00:00:03,836 --> 00:00:05,836
(Episode 54)

4
00:00:14,210 --> 00:00:16,030
You can't stop me.

5
00:00:16,600 --> 00:00:17,600
Give up.

6
00:00:20,678 --> 00:00:21,692
What are you doing?

7
00:00:21,694 --> 00:00:23,132
The General wants to see you.

8
00:00:23,738 --> 00:00:24,856
What a joke.

9
00:00:25,505 --> 00:00:27,149
Are we in the military or something?

10
00:00:31,872 --> 00:00:32,928
Right this way.

11
00:00:34,101 --> 00:00:35,267
This is assault!

12
00:00:35,269 --> 00:00:36,275
I'll report you!

13
00:00:46,817 --> 00:00:47,817
Ji Hu.

14
00:00:49,365 --> 00:00:51,126
You've suffered so much.

15
00:00:51,478 --> 00:00:53,340
I had no idea. I'm sorry.

16
00:00:54,338 --> 00:00:55,338
Don't be.

17
00:01:04,418 --> 00:01:05,418
Yes, Ambassador.

18
00:01:05,905 --> 00:01:08,417
Your daughter stole a tablet
from one of our employees,

19
00:01:08,964 --> 00:01:10,481
then took one of our ideas...

20
00:01:10,775 --> 00:01:12,958
to register a copyright in her name.

21
00:01:13,009 --> 00:01:14,009
No!

22
00:01:14,385 --> 00:01:17,144
No, Dad! It wasn't me!

23
00:01:17,365 --> 00:01:20,483
I can send you all the evidence.

24
00:01:22,684 --> 00:01:25,596
Sir, you clearly underestimate me.

25
00:01:26,298 --> 00:01:28,056
I have some clout of my own.

26
00:01:28,891 --> 00:01:31,413
I enjoy a quiet life...

27
00:01:31,437 --> 00:01:33,316
finding simple joy in publishing books,

28
00:01:33,964 --> 00:01:35,887
not because I couldn't break into
national politics.

29
00:01:36,192 --> 00:01:38,237
I want to make that perfectly clear.

30
00:01:44,298 --> 00:01:47,511
- Father!
- No. You're no longer part of my family.

31
00:01:47,758 --> 00:01:50,099
They say it's hard
for young people to take rejection.

32
00:01:50,317 --> 00:01:52,313
But life is either yes or no.

33
00:01:52,555 --> 00:01:54,237
You can't expect every answer to be yes.

34
00:01:54,852 --> 00:01:56,943
Think carefully before you act.

35
00:01:57,812 --> 00:02:00,915
As I've said, I'll always protect my own.

36
00:02:05,185 --> 00:02:07,315
I always do what I want too.

37
00:02:08,232 --> 00:02:09,232
Rejection?

38
00:02:10,405 --> 00:02:11,692
Spare me.

39
00:02:11,911 --> 00:02:13,459
Who dares to reject me?

40
00:02:15,698 --> 00:02:16,791
If I can't have it,

41
00:02:17,834 --> 00:02:19,115
I'll destroy it.

42
00:02:25,965 --> 00:02:27,177
This won't be easy.

43
00:02:28,792 --> 00:02:30,685
- Keep a close eye on her.
- Yes, sir.

44
00:02:53,161 --> 00:02:54,762
- Mom.
- Yes.

45
00:02:55,167 --> 00:02:58,007
Did something happen at home?

46
00:02:58,038 --> 00:02:59,649
Something doesn't feel right.

47
00:03:03,218 --> 00:03:04,218
What?

48
00:03:04,427 --> 00:03:06,254
They packed their bags
and left that late at night?

49
00:03:06,475 --> 00:03:08,997
- Where did they go?
- I don't know.

50
00:03:09,022 --> 00:03:10,713
You let them go without stopping them?

51
00:03:10,738 --> 00:03:12,680
They have nowhere to go.

52
00:03:12,723 --> 00:03:14,860
But Mom, did you know about...

53
00:03:15,498 --> 00:03:17,778
- Sa Bin having drinks with that woman?
- What?

54
00:03:17,796 --> 00:03:20,502
Seung Woo said you had no idea.

55
00:03:21,718 --> 00:03:24,817
That's why Seung Woo called me yesterday.

56
00:03:25,598 --> 00:03:27,620
I dozed off after dinner,

57
00:03:27,644 --> 00:03:29,207
so I must've missed Sa Bin's calls.

58
00:03:30,005 --> 00:03:32,535
Seung Woo has such a temper.

59
00:03:33,238 --> 00:03:34,731
So Seung Woo misunderstood?

60
00:03:35,032 --> 00:03:37,928
Well, you can see why.

61
00:03:38,101 --> 00:03:39,867
Ji Ni got angry and left too.

62
00:03:39,891 --> 00:03:41,112
Even Ji Ni?

63
00:03:43,032 --> 00:03:44,484
That sweet girl must've had enough.

64
00:03:45,267 --> 00:03:48,728
I can imagine
how furious Seung Woo must've been.

65
00:03:49,312 --> 00:03:51,214
Why didn't you stop him?

66
00:03:51,372 --> 00:03:53,329
Because he said they'd lied to you.

67
00:03:54,440 --> 00:03:57,645
Why is everything
getting so complicated lately?

68
00:04:04,391 --> 00:04:06,236
He isn't even answering my call.

69
00:04:18,078 --> 00:04:20,139
The door was open, Yeong Ju.

70
00:04:20,550 --> 00:04:22,040
Shouldn't you be seeing patients?

71
00:04:22,365 --> 00:04:23,954
I don't have any this afternoon.

72
00:04:23,979 --> 00:04:26,002
- Are you doing okay?
- Yes.

73
00:04:31,352 --> 00:04:33,195
Yeong Ju.

74
00:04:34,190 --> 00:04:36,261
You can't just leave like that.

75
00:04:36,285 --> 00:04:38,313
I told your brother.

76
00:04:38,992 --> 00:04:40,724
- That's unfair.
- How so?

77
00:04:41,149 --> 00:04:43,024
Do you know how much trouble...

78
00:04:43,053 --> 00:04:44,620
your careless behavior is causing?

79
00:04:44,870 --> 00:04:45,870
Me?

80
00:04:52,632 --> 00:04:55,413
It's me. Come home right now.

81
00:04:56,172 --> 00:04:58,148
I said come home. Hurry up.

82
00:04:58,451 --> 00:05:01,800
I'm putting an end to that
temper of yours today.

83
00:05:02,437 --> 00:05:05,529
If you're going to make such a scene,
you'd better know the whole story.

84
00:05:05,554 --> 00:05:07,452
If you believe everything you hear
and act before you think,

85
00:05:07,476 --> 00:05:09,735
you'll ruin your life and everyone else's.

86
00:05:12,730 --> 00:05:14,621
Yeong Ju, please don't be mad anymore.

87
00:05:17,765 --> 00:05:19,789
If I didn't answer my phone yesterday,

88
00:05:20,010 --> 00:05:22,180
you could've just come home.

89
00:05:22,205 --> 00:05:24,056
Couldn't the drinks have waited
until today?

90
00:05:24,561 --> 00:05:26,889
You can't just go
whenever you get a green light...

91
00:05:26,913 --> 00:05:29,145
and expect to end up in the right place.

92
00:05:29,627 --> 00:05:32,534
I'm your GPS. Follow my directions!

93
00:05:32,559 --> 00:05:35,191
So stop when I give you a red light.

94
00:05:36,410 --> 00:05:38,737
Got it. Red light, green light.

95
00:05:45,345 --> 00:05:46,849
- A misunderstanding?
- Yes.

96
00:05:47,222 --> 00:05:49,745
I'd be against it
if anything were going on.

97
00:05:49,769 --> 00:05:50,945
But there isn't.

98
00:05:51,102 --> 00:05:53,053
Go apologize and bring them back.

99
00:05:53,412 --> 00:05:55,150
Even if you live apart,
don't do it like this.

100
00:05:56,738 --> 00:05:57,738
No.

101
00:05:58,272 --> 00:06:00,011
We'll just live apart.

102
00:06:00,337 --> 00:06:02,254
So what if I misunderstood?
I won't clear it up.

103
00:06:02,279 --> 00:06:03,388
Cha Seung Woo!

104
00:06:03,871 --> 00:06:05,394
You didn't know about it.

105
00:06:06,077 --> 00:06:08,657
I called you, remember?
I'd have let it go if you'd known.

106
00:06:08,669 --> 00:06:09,785
That's...

107
00:06:10,016 --> 00:06:12,390
Sa Bin and I failed to communicate.

108
00:06:12,838 --> 00:06:14,440
Just apologize this once.

109
00:06:14,698 --> 00:06:16,413
It's both a request and an order.

110
00:06:17,725 --> 00:06:20,159
Remember what Ji Ni did for us.

111
00:06:20,677 --> 00:06:22,697
She didn't just apologize.

112
00:06:22,721 --> 00:06:24,360
She proved it with her actions.

113
00:06:24,552 --> 00:06:27,092
That takes incredible courage,
especially at her age.

114
00:06:28,288 --> 00:06:29,730
Mom.

115
00:06:29,755 --> 00:06:32,466
I can never forget the kindness
Ji Ni showed us.

116
00:06:32,852 --> 00:06:35,194
You mustn't forget it either. Okay?

117
00:06:35,511 --> 00:06:36,511
And I...

118
00:06:36,872 --> 00:06:38,695
stopped judging Ji Ni by her mom
a long time ago.

119
00:06:38,958 --> 00:06:39,958
You need to do the same.

120
00:06:41,221 --> 00:06:42,481
Seriously...

121
00:06:50,825 --> 00:06:51,842
Maestro?

122
00:06:52,357 --> 00:06:53,362
Maestro!

123
00:06:56,936 --> 00:06:58,356
When did you arrive?

124
00:06:58,381 --> 00:06:59,469
I didn't hear you come in.

125
00:06:59,494 --> 00:07:00,869
Yeong Ju.

126
00:07:14,131 --> 00:07:16,260
What? You want to know why I came back?

127
00:07:16,285 --> 00:07:18,565
- I came to get my things.
- Se Ri.

128
00:07:18,750 --> 00:07:21,231
I'm sorry. Seung Woo got it wrong.

129
00:07:25,292 --> 00:07:28,303
Sa Bin drank with me too.
Why aren't you blaming him?

130
00:07:28,400 --> 00:07:29,947
This is so unfair.

131
00:07:30,725 --> 00:07:33,810
I should've kept calling
until Yeong Ju answered.

132
00:07:34,093 --> 00:07:35,785
I was too careless. I'm sorry.

133
00:07:40,611 --> 00:07:41,702
I'm sorry.

134
00:07:42,030 --> 00:07:43,179
I was wrong.

135
00:07:44,520 --> 00:07:46,970
Se Ri, let's talk first.

136
00:07:47,145 --> 00:07:48,384
Cha Seung Woo, come in.

137
00:07:48,630 --> 00:07:49,843
Come on. Hurry.

138
00:08:05,124 --> 00:08:08,554
He got the wrong idea. I'm sorry, Se Ri.

139
00:08:09,545 --> 00:08:12,349
What happened to the guy
who was yelling his head off?

140
00:08:16,018 --> 00:08:17,116
I apologize.

141
00:08:18,474 --> 00:08:20,500
Do you know what he said to me?

142
00:08:20,525 --> 00:08:23,702
He insulted me nonstop in front of Ji Ni.

143
00:08:23,987 --> 00:08:26,179
Ji Ni must be deeply hurt.

144
00:08:27,605 --> 00:08:29,832
Where did you spend the night?

145
00:08:30,278 --> 00:08:32,484
At a guesthouse. Where else could I go?

146
00:08:32,509 --> 00:08:34,154
Absolutely not.

147
00:08:34,179 --> 00:08:35,622
Tell her to come home now.

148
00:08:35,646 --> 00:08:37,204
Seriously.

149
00:08:40,418 --> 00:08:42,969
She's not answering.

150
00:08:43,972 --> 00:08:44,972
You bring her back.

151
00:08:45,461 --> 00:08:47,292
Ji Ni? Why should I?

152
00:08:47,465 --> 00:08:48,859
You're the one who made her leave.

153
00:08:53,857 --> 00:08:54,857
Look.

154
00:08:55,367 --> 00:08:58,370
Ji Ni drew this as a gift for you.

155
00:08:58,536 --> 00:09:00,831
You really only care about yourself.

156
00:09:00,883 --> 00:09:03,254
Do you know
how much Ji Ni cares about all of you?

157
00:09:04,661 --> 00:09:05,792
My goodness.

158
00:09:07,364 --> 00:09:08,920
It's your mess. Fix it.

159
00:09:08,945 --> 00:09:10,818
And try to control your temper.

160
00:09:14,304 --> 00:09:16,217
Unpack your bag, Se Ri.

161
00:09:17,912 --> 00:09:20,295
I'm so upset, Yeong Ju.

162
00:09:20,320 --> 00:09:23,713
I don't know if I can live with people...

163
00:09:23,714 --> 00:09:25,363
who are always ready to misunderstand me.

164
00:09:26,078 --> 00:09:30,366
The kids act that way
because they've been deeply hurt too.

165
00:09:30,390 --> 00:09:31,682
Don't be upset.

166
00:09:43,572 --> 00:09:45,164
I was going to take 100,000 dollars...

167
00:09:45,249 --> 00:09:46,872
and use it to move out.

168
00:09:47,695 --> 00:09:49,036
But Ji Ni tore it up.

169
00:09:49,984 --> 00:09:53,502
She said she'd cut ties with me
if I took even a cent for O Reum's life.

170
00:09:53,700 --> 00:09:55,068
That's just how she is.

171
00:09:55,092 --> 00:09:57,136
Do you know how much she cares about you?

172
00:09:58,825 --> 00:10:00,214
I can't do it all at once,

173
00:10:01,085 --> 00:10:02,658
but I'll make sure to show my gratitude.

174
00:10:02,683 --> 00:10:04,880
Tell him to apologize properly to Ji Ni.

175
00:10:05,167 --> 00:10:06,502
And you need to do better too.

176
00:10:06,527 --> 00:10:07,977
You treat her like a stranger.

177
00:10:08,439 --> 00:10:10,823
I've really mellowed out.

178
00:10:21,965 --> 00:10:23,466
What's this?

179
00:10:24,711 --> 00:10:25,872
Did Ji Ni draw this?

180
00:10:26,427 --> 00:10:27,427
Yeah.

181
00:10:27,867 --> 00:10:29,675
This is driving me crazy.

182
00:10:30,238 --> 00:10:31,755
Why won't mom take my side?

183
00:10:31,779 --> 00:10:33,843
- Isn't that a good thing?
- What?

184
00:10:34,593 --> 00:10:36,113
I was worried she'd get upset too,

185
00:10:36,137 --> 00:10:38,190
and we'd repeat what happened in the past.

186
00:10:38,565 --> 00:10:40,077
I'm glad she's confident.

187
00:10:40,358 --> 00:10:41,785
She and Sa Bin have each other's backs.

188
00:10:42,372 --> 00:10:44,082
It's reassuring to see them...

189
00:10:44,106 --> 00:10:46,932
building a strong bond no one can break.

190
00:10:47,094 --> 00:10:49,618
Anyway, you always get
to say the nice things.

191
00:10:50,359 --> 00:10:51,935
No little brother tops his big brother.

192
00:10:53,045 --> 00:10:55,536
And apologize to Ji Ni too.

193
00:10:56,858 --> 00:10:58,967
- What?
- What did she do wrong?

194
00:10:59,225 --> 00:11:01,390
If we did nothing wrong,
then neither did she.

195
00:11:02,625 --> 00:11:03,625
That man...

196
00:11:03,989 --> 00:11:05,691
lived life the way he wanted.
This is what it cost him.

197
00:11:06,107 --> 00:11:09,299
I should've given him a harder time
while he was still alive.

198
00:11:09,902 --> 00:11:11,649
Don't brag about your temper.

199
00:11:11,998 --> 00:11:13,889
I nearly got myself in trouble
because of it too.

200
00:11:28,064 --> 00:11:29,734
<i>Shine again</i>

201
00:11:29,752 --> 00:11:32,195
<i>My dream that will never fade</i>

202
00:11:32,220 --> 00:11:34,634
<i>Run to the edge of the sky</i>

203
00:11:34,658 --> 00:11:38,221
<i>Burn away even your fears</i>

204
00:11:38,223 --> 00:11:42,206
<i>Shine again, the voice inside me</i>

205
00:11:42,231 --> 00:11:45,177
<i>cries out to the world</i>

206
00:11:45,495 --> 00:11:49,278
<i>I'm alive</i>

207
00:11:50,247 --> 00:11:52,437
Ji Ni!

208
00:11:56,231 --> 00:11:59,399
- Go, The Captain's Library Publishing!
- Go!

209
00:11:59,401 --> 00:12:00,712
Go, Na Ji Ni!

210
00:12:08,611 --> 00:12:11,889
<i>You came into my life like sunshine</i>

211
00:12:11,913 --> 00:12:16,659
<i>And my heart started to sway</i>

212
00:12:17,023 --> 00:12:20,978
<i>Even the simplest hello</i>

213
00:12:21,002 --> 00:12:24,702
<i>can make my whole day shine</i>

214
00:12:24,727 --> 00:12:29,530
<i>When I hear your footsteps near</i>

215
00:12:29,597 --> 00:12:33,215
<i>I can't help but hold my breath</i>

216
00:12:33,239 --> 00:12:36,879
<i>Even when I pretend I'm fine</i>

217
00:12:36,903 --> 00:12:41,003
<i>My heart already belongs to you</i>

218
00:12:42,487 --> 00:12:45,930
<i>That's all I need</i>

219
00:12:51,235 --> 00:12:55,144
<i>This moment walking with you</i>

220
00:12:55,417 --> 00:12:59,590
<i>fills my heart with excitement</i>

221
00:13:03,972 --> 00:13:04,972
Here, have this.

222
00:13:06,103 --> 00:13:07,103
Thanks.

223
00:13:07,351 --> 00:13:08,532
Thank you.

224
00:13:15,804 --> 00:13:16,931
I called a cab.

225
00:13:17,912 --> 00:13:20,340
Yeah, I'm fine. I'm really okay.

226
00:13:21,813 --> 00:13:23,102
Don't read it. It's not worth it.

227
00:13:24,758 --> 00:13:26,473
I don't want to care about it,

228
00:13:27,492 --> 00:13:29,583
but I'm just worried my mom might see it.

229
00:13:31,071 --> 00:13:32,840
What am I supposed to do?

230
00:13:33,143 --> 00:13:34,782
I'm sorry. I don't know what to say.

231
00:13:35,738 --> 00:13:38,237
My dad contacted Ambassador Do himself.

232
00:13:38,772 --> 00:13:41,216
Do Hee's scared of my dad too,
so I'm sure it'll have an effect.

233
00:13:41,440 --> 00:13:43,344
I hope so. Please.

234
00:13:49,724 --> 00:13:51,598
Ji Hu, come talk to me for a minute.

235
00:13:56,831 --> 00:13:58,360
Go. Don't worry.

236
00:13:58,860 --> 00:14:01,395
- Tae O.
- I know how you feel. I'll handle this.

237
00:14:01,684 --> 00:14:03,267
Things are tense right now.

238
00:14:03,803 --> 00:14:05,955
Just stay out of sight for now.

239
00:14:06,250 --> 00:14:07,335
Go.

240
00:14:09,271 --> 00:14:10,784
Okay. I understand. I'm counting on you.

241
00:14:10,809 --> 00:14:12,387
No. Don't count on me.

242
00:14:12,798 --> 00:14:14,555
I can help just by
using my relationship with Ji Ni.

243
00:14:16,628 --> 00:14:18,327
Okay. I'm sorry.

244
00:14:21,865 --> 00:14:23,805
Ji Ni, your cab is coming.

245
00:14:23,858 --> 00:14:24,938
We just need to get to the main road.

246
00:14:27,178 --> 00:14:29,108
You usually handle your liquor so well.
How did you get this drunk?

247
00:14:30,976 --> 00:14:31,982
Exactly.

248
00:14:32,916 --> 00:14:34,604
Lean on me. Let's go.

249
00:14:35,735 --> 00:14:36,735
Okay.

250
00:14:57,952 --> 00:15:00,376
Mom, I'm coming over.

251
00:15:02,177 --> 00:15:03,177
What?

252
00:15:03,952 --> 00:15:05,541
Why are you going there?

253
00:15:06,908 --> 00:15:08,829
Get out of there right now.
Don't you have any pride?

254
00:15:09,793 --> 00:15:11,498
I don't want you there.

255
00:15:11,898 --> 00:15:13,385
Just take your things and leave.

256
00:15:15,012 --> 00:15:17,071
Anywhere is fine with me,
as long as it's not there.

257
00:15:20,645 --> 00:15:21,645
Is that your mom?

258
00:15:22,079 --> 00:15:23,079
What's wrong?

259
00:15:23,532 --> 00:15:25,236
She went back to that house.

260
00:15:25,290 --> 00:15:26,290
Does that make any sense?

261
00:15:26,566 --> 00:15:28,671
She must have her reasons.

262
00:15:29,272 --> 00:15:31,518
Go there tonight, then.

263
00:15:32,118 --> 00:15:33,571
It's dangerous for you to be alone.

264
00:15:34,752 --> 00:15:36,318
I'd rather be in danger.

265
00:15:37,772 --> 00:15:39,429
You can be such a child sometimes.

266
00:15:40,410 --> 00:15:41,410
What?

267
00:15:42,054 --> 00:15:43,054
Never mind.

268
00:15:43,225 --> 00:15:44,250
Go there tonight.

269
00:15:45,065 --> 00:15:46,285
Listen to your mom.

270
00:15:49,118 --> 00:15:50,348
Ji Ni, the cab's here.

271
00:15:50,665 --> 00:15:51,665
Let's go.

272
00:15:53,472 --> 00:15:54,472
Take it slow.

273
00:16:02,998 --> 00:16:03,998
Ji Ni...

274
00:16:04,355 --> 00:16:05,590
still hasn't come home.

275
00:16:06,617 --> 00:16:08,371
Would she even want to come back?

276
00:16:08,532 --> 00:16:10,792
When I told her I was here,
she started screaming at me.

277
00:16:10,794 --> 00:16:12,109
Where is she now?

278
00:16:12,111 --> 00:16:13,637
Why do you want to know?

279
00:16:15,398 --> 00:16:16,579
Should I go get her?

280
00:16:17,700 --> 00:16:18,700
Really?

281
00:16:25,918 --> 00:16:26,918
Ji Ni,

282
00:16:28,874 --> 00:16:30,139
will you date me?

283
00:16:31,486 --> 00:16:32,544
All of a sudden?

284
00:16:32,605 --> 00:16:34,374
I think you and Ji Hu...

285
00:16:34,641 --> 00:16:36,522
need someone to protect you...

286
00:16:36,851 --> 00:16:38,459
from Do Hee's grip.

287
00:16:39,971 --> 00:16:41,458
I'll be your shield.

288
00:16:42,038 --> 00:16:44,957
If you say we're dating,
this storm will die down.

289
00:16:45,633 --> 00:16:46,633
Use me.

290
00:16:47,033 --> 00:16:48,139
"My shield?"

291
00:16:50,018 --> 00:16:51,018
That's ridiculous.

292
00:16:55,645 --> 00:16:56,645
Ji Ni,

293
00:16:57,227 --> 00:17:00,089
I'd gladly be a wall
that shields you from the storm.

294
00:17:00,431 --> 00:17:01,557
Why are you here now?

295
00:17:04,732 --> 00:17:05,732
You should go.

296
00:17:06,253 --> 00:17:07,897
Okay. Get some rest.

297
00:17:09,145 --> 00:17:10,567
Think about what I said.

298
00:17:11,532 --> 00:17:13,391
Even a wall has a door.

299
00:17:13,738 --> 00:17:15,155
You can open it anytime.

300
00:17:20,832 --> 00:17:22,052
What is he even talking about?

301
00:17:22,705 --> 00:17:23,857
I'm not here to stay.

302
00:17:23,992 --> 00:17:25,164
I'm here to get my mom.

303
00:17:25,192 --> 00:17:27,293
Have a seat.

304
00:17:27,294 --> 00:17:28,585
I don't have much to say.

305
00:17:32,005 --> 00:17:33,108
I do.

306
00:17:36,518 --> 00:17:37,585
Have you been drinking?

307
00:17:37,665 --> 00:17:38,890
Just say what you wanted to say.

308
00:17:40,532 --> 00:17:42,843
You're scary when you're cold, too.

309
00:17:46,758 --> 00:17:48,379
I'm sorry I misunderstood.

310
00:17:48,532 --> 00:17:50,381
- Hey, but if you were me...
- No.

311
00:17:51,252 --> 00:17:53,278
I would've trusted you no matter what.

312
00:17:53,625 --> 00:17:56,690
When Jung A told me
the woman you were seeing was married,

313
00:17:58,079 --> 00:18:00,291
I thought there had to be a reason.

314
00:18:01,692 --> 00:18:03,878
I didn't think, "Like father, like son."

315
00:18:04,158 --> 00:18:06,587
I never thought or said anything
like that.

316
00:18:08,488 --> 00:18:10,359
I know. I remember.

317
00:18:10,360 --> 00:18:12,107
Even when I found out later
that you didn't know,

318
00:18:12,846 --> 00:18:14,626
I thought, "That figures."

319
00:18:15,340 --> 00:18:16,610
"That must've hurt."

320
00:18:17,152 --> 00:18:19,404
"It must've hurt when someone he trusted
hurt him."

321
00:18:20,918 --> 00:18:21,918
I'm sorry.

322
00:18:23,299 --> 00:18:24,299
Okay.

323
00:18:25,258 --> 00:18:27,105
You can disrespect my mom.

324
00:18:27,838 --> 00:18:30,678
But what you did in front of me
was the worst.

325
00:18:31,871 --> 00:18:34,949
It hurts as much as what I went through
when I was a kid.

326
00:18:37,272 --> 00:18:40,363
What happened back then
has been weighing on me.

327
00:18:41,495 --> 00:18:42,495
I'm sorry.

328
00:18:42,991 --> 00:18:43,991
Back then,

329
00:18:44,170 --> 00:18:45,611
you were young too.

330
00:18:46,245 --> 00:18:47,783
I can understand that.

331
00:18:48,518 --> 00:18:49,810
But this time,

332
00:18:50,995 --> 00:18:52,209
I'm really angry.

333
00:18:55,272 --> 00:18:56,672
Don't leave. Stay home.

334
00:18:56,885 --> 00:18:58,125
I'll accept your apology.

335
00:19:13,272 --> 00:19:14,678
Good for you.

336
00:19:14,792 --> 00:19:16,060
That felt so good.

337
00:19:16,952 --> 00:19:18,685
Why are you eavesdropping?

338
00:19:19,445 --> 00:19:21,573
I was going to come meet you,

339
00:19:21,574 --> 00:19:23,684
but Seung Woo said he'd go instead.

340
00:19:24,158 --> 00:19:26,618
That doesn't mean I can just come in here
and put my feet up.

341
00:19:26,725 --> 00:19:28,256
I just happened to hear it.

342
00:19:28,511 --> 00:19:31,651
But I guess
Ji Hu didn't drive you home today?

343
00:19:31,959 --> 00:19:34,031
- Mind your own business.
- Good.

344
00:19:34,105 --> 00:19:35,747
Don't see Ji Hu for now.

345
00:19:36,491 --> 00:19:37,896
I won't see him later either.

346
00:19:37,898 --> 00:19:40,160
I've told you a hundred times,
I don't love him.

347
00:19:40,381 --> 00:19:41,978
- You brat.
- What?

348
00:19:42,625 --> 00:19:44,880
I hope you have
a daughter who's just like you someday!

349
00:19:44,985 --> 00:19:46,430
Then you'll know how I feel.

350
00:19:46,432 --> 00:19:49,389
Have twins.
Two kids who are exactly like you!

351
00:19:49,683 --> 00:19:50,683
That brat.

352
00:20:00,272 --> 00:20:01,495
Have you been drinking?

353
00:20:03,231 --> 00:20:04,231
Ma'am,

354
00:20:04,404 --> 00:20:05,506
what are you doing here?

355
00:20:05,965 --> 00:20:07,678
I just...

356
00:20:07,777 --> 00:20:08,886
Don't tell me...

357
00:20:09,349 --> 00:20:10,657
Is it because of mom?

358
00:20:10,659 --> 00:20:13,492
I can't say it isn't,
but I can't say it is either.

359
00:20:14,265 --> 00:20:15,480
Don't worry about it.

360
00:20:15,925 --> 00:20:18,428
I'm just having some adjustment pains.

361
00:20:18,569 --> 00:20:19,810
Are you feeling sick?

362
00:20:20,191 --> 00:20:21,525
Something like that.

363
00:20:21,912 --> 00:20:23,972
I used to live here however I pleased,

364
00:20:23,974 --> 00:20:26,838
but now that I'm married,
there's so much to worry about.

365
00:20:27,885 --> 00:20:29,310
I came here to clear my head.

366
00:20:30,245 --> 00:20:31,475
I'm glad you did.

367
00:20:32,604 --> 00:20:33,930
I wanted to see you.

368
00:20:33,952 --> 00:20:35,538
I wanted to see you too.

369
00:20:37,308 --> 00:20:39,342
I heard what happened.

370
00:20:39,683 --> 00:20:40,930
It must've been upsetting.

371
00:20:41,492 --> 00:20:43,894
I gave Seung Woo quite a scolding.

372
00:20:44,961 --> 00:20:46,137
You did?

373
00:20:47,472 --> 00:20:48,823
You were all traumatized...

374
00:20:48,859 --> 00:20:51,211
because of what we put you through.

375
00:20:51,585 --> 00:20:54,158
I thought we'd all gotten much better.

376
00:20:55,231 --> 00:20:56,763
Please understand, for my sake.

377
00:20:57,005 --> 00:20:58,623
It won't happen again.

378
00:20:58,952 --> 00:21:01,678
Don't think about leaving.
Stay here with your mom.

379
00:21:02,612 --> 00:21:05,028
I heard you stood up
to Seung Woo this time.

380
00:21:06,569 --> 00:21:07,717
Good for you.

381
00:21:08,365 --> 00:21:11,139
You were always keeping your head down,
walking on eggshells,

382
00:21:11,389 --> 00:21:13,405
and apologizing before
anyone even said anything.

383
00:21:13,613 --> 00:21:15,005
It broke my heart.

384
00:21:15,665 --> 00:21:16,937
Actually,

385
00:21:17,467 --> 00:21:19,750
I always felt like
I was trapped somewhere.

386
00:21:20,765 --> 00:21:21,975
But recently,

387
00:21:22,667 --> 00:21:24,925
someone helped me get out.

388
00:21:25,985 --> 00:21:27,918
I don't want to keep bottling things up.

389
00:21:28,899 --> 00:21:30,053
Good.

390
00:21:30,285 --> 00:21:31,771
I wish I could thank whoever it was.

391
00:21:36,938 --> 00:21:38,988
Have this tomorrow for your hangover.

392
00:21:39,637 --> 00:21:40,941
Ma'am.

393
00:21:41,978 --> 00:21:43,275
If you leave,

394
00:21:43,542 --> 00:21:46,169
I won't be able to handle married life.
I'll be worried.

395
00:21:46,496 --> 00:21:47,496
What?

396
00:21:49,418 --> 00:21:50,988
Please stay here. You have to.

397
00:21:51,089 --> 00:21:52,089
Okay?

398
00:21:58,905 --> 00:21:59,905
Really?

399
00:22:00,070 --> 00:22:01,070
Yeah.

400
00:22:01,178 --> 00:22:04,235
After you mentioned the opportunity
to model as a senior,

401
00:22:04,237 --> 00:22:06,238
I got another offer too.

402
00:22:06,446 --> 00:22:09,371
So I've been practicing hard
at an academy lately.

403
00:22:09,372 --> 00:22:10,905
That's great.

404
00:22:11,232 --> 00:22:13,872
Then walk in my sister's fashion show.

405
00:22:13,982 --> 00:22:15,647
The one in Dongdaemun?

406
00:22:15,648 --> 00:22:17,230
Yeah, it's a festival.

407
00:22:17,232 --> 00:22:19,725
There's a lot going on.
It'll be really fun.

408
00:22:20,258 --> 00:22:24,178
If you don't mind my lack of experience,
I'd love to.

409
00:22:24,532 --> 00:22:26,592
Let's meet my sister first.

410
00:22:27,125 --> 00:22:28,446
I'll set up a meeting, okay?

411
00:22:28,754 --> 00:22:29,935
Thank you.

412
00:22:30,040 --> 00:22:31,046
I'll do my best.

413
00:22:33,013 --> 00:22:34,616
Where did I put my phone?

414
00:22:37,798 --> 00:22:38,894
Really?

415
00:22:39,223 --> 00:22:40,536
That's great.

416
00:22:41,010 --> 00:22:42,511
A good start is half the battle.

417
00:22:42,945 --> 00:22:44,905
I'll come with you to the meeting.

418
00:22:46,205 --> 00:22:48,477
We'll need to sign a contract too.

419
00:22:50,605 --> 00:22:52,711
I'm doing this to make money too.

420
00:22:53,623 --> 00:22:54,623
Okay.

421
00:22:55,457 --> 00:22:58,623
Got it. I'll keep it a secret
from Cha Seung Woo.

422
00:22:59,258 --> 00:23:00,258
Yeah.

423
00:23:07,058 --> 00:23:08,424
What's got you smiling to yourself?

424
00:23:08,879 --> 00:23:10,490
What? It's nothing.

425
00:23:12,558 --> 00:23:14,571
Our show is doing well.

426
00:23:15,178 --> 00:23:16,691
We should start planning Season 2.

427
00:23:17,257 --> 00:23:18,676
That reminds me,

428
00:23:18,929 --> 00:23:21,411
how about foreigners for Season 2...

429
00:23:21,545 --> 00:23:23,178
and their experiences adapting to Korea?

430
00:23:23,798 --> 00:23:27,165
We could show them working in Korea,
dating, and so on.

431
00:23:27,185 --> 00:23:29,938
It could be fun to watch them
adapt more to life in Korea.

432
00:23:30,131 --> 00:23:31,691
It's a global world now, after all.

433
00:23:32,232 --> 00:23:34,793
You talk tough, but you've got good ideas.

434
00:23:35,800 --> 00:23:36,893
You cute little thing.

435
00:23:38,130 --> 00:23:39,359
What's gotten into you?

436
00:23:50,013 --> 00:23:51,525
Welcome.

437
00:23:51,527 --> 00:23:53,158
Nice to see you again.

438
00:23:53,258 --> 00:23:55,807
I was passing by and saw you here,
so I thought I'd stop by.

439
00:23:56,369 --> 00:23:58,696
- Yes.
- About what you mentioned before,

440
00:23:58,698 --> 00:24:00,111
I guess things worked out well?

441
00:24:00,152 --> 00:24:01,730
You look much happier.

442
00:24:03,438 --> 00:24:06,693
After everything we went through,
it all worked out in the end.

443
00:24:07,348 --> 00:24:10,276
I don't mind going through hard times
myself, but when my kid suffers,

444
00:24:10,278 --> 00:24:12,511
- it breaks my heart.
- Exactly.

445
00:24:12,571 --> 00:24:13,571
Lately,

446
00:24:13,620 --> 00:24:15,320
I've been worried about my son too.

447
00:24:15,833 --> 00:24:18,158
I'm sure it'll all work out.
It did for me.

448
00:24:18,452 --> 00:24:19,578
Just give it some time.

449
00:24:19,579 --> 00:24:21,385
Right, the magic of waiting...

450
00:24:23,378 --> 00:24:24,641
By the way, what's that?

451
00:24:24,667 --> 00:24:25,815
(Dongdaemun Festival)

452
00:24:26,071 --> 00:24:28,288
Some of the clothes here were purchased,

453
00:24:28,289 --> 00:24:31,810
but most were designed by
my boss's sister.

454
00:24:31,998 --> 00:24:34,696
She's entering them in
the Dongdaemun Festival fashion show.

455
00:24:34,698 --> 00:24:36,031
Is that so?

456
00:24:36,638 --> 00:24:39,251
I might even walk in the show as a model.

457
00:24:41,512 --> 00:24:43,221
Do I look like a model?

458
00:24:43,222 --> 00:24:44,893
Of course. You look like a real model.

459
00:24:44,920 --> 00:24:46,685
Really? Thank you.

460
00:24:46,719 --> 00:24:48,337
I'll do my best.

461
00:24:48,338 --> 00:24:49,338
Congratulations.

462
00:24:49,685 --> 00:24:51,043
I'll make time to come.

463
00:24:51,077 --> 00:24:53,259
No, it's such a short event,

464
00:24:53,260 --> 00:24:55,183
I can't guarantee you'll even see me.

465
00:24:55,184 --> 00:24:56,184
I see.

466
00:24:56,271 --> 00:24:58,491
Either way, it's great news,
Ms. Senior Model.

467
00:24:58,985 --> 00:25:00,126
You know that expression too?

468
00:25:00,128 --> 00:25:01,751
Of course. I'm a senior too.

469
00:25:04,018 --> 00:25:05,231
We got carried away talking.

470
00:25:05,451 --> 00:25:06,717
Yes. You should get going.

471
00:25:06,719 --> 00:25:08,375
- I kept you too long.
- It's okay.

472
00:25:09,041 --> 00:25:10,232
- Take care.
- You too.

473
00:25:18,218 --> 00:25:19,218
Honey,

474
00:25:19,505 --> 00:25:21,551
I think I'm going to become a model.

475
00:25:22,318 --> 00:25:25,694
You always said it was a shame for me
to just sit around with my cello,

476
00:25:26,145 --> 00:25:27,465
so I want to give it a try.

477
00:25:28,498 --> 00:25:31,858
I want to be a mom our Ji Ni can rely on.

478
00:25:57,267 --> 00:25:59,592
(Dongdaemun Festival)

479
00:26:06,978 --> 00:26:10,497
- Se Ri.
- Yeong Ju.

480
00:26:10,499 --> 00:26:12,623
You look amazing. As expected.

481
00:26:12,624 --> 00:26:15,623
- Thanks.
- Congratulations.

482
00:26:17,160 --> 00:26:19,285
- Should I put it here?
- Yeah, let's put it here.

483
00:26:19,287 --> 00:26:20,512
Seriously.

484
00:26:20,514 --> 00:26:21,514
(Go, model Na Se Ri! Im Joong Bin)

485
00:26:21,516 --> 00:26:23,455
- Maestro.
- Sa Bin.

486
00:26:23,530 --> 00:26:24,763
Calming medicine.

487
00:26:25,225 --> 00:26:26,498
Did you two come together?

488
00:26:26,898 --> 00:26:28,192
Yeong Ju.

489
00:26:30,356 --> 00:26:31,770
Can't you two get on the same page?

490
00:26:31,772 --> 00:26:33,512
Don't get me scolded again.

491
00:26:35,305 --> 00:26:37,221
Should we take a picture?

492
00:26:37,223 --> 00:26:38,505
Sure. Let's take one.

493
00:26:39,443 --> 00:26:40,443
Just a second.

494
00:26:41,898 --> 00:26:43,698
One, two, three.

495
00:26:45,125 --> 00:26:46,143
Se Ri.

496
00:26:46,424 --> 00:26:47,877
- You're up next.
- Okay.

497
00:26:49,688 --> 00:26:51,805
Se Ri, good luck!

498
00:26:52,370 --> 00:26:53,370
Good luck!

499
00:27:00,427 --> 00:27:02,405
- Shall we go?
- Okay.

500
00:28:03,792 --> 00:28:07,198
(Family Register)

501
00:28:07,199 --> 00:28:08,403
I came because I wanted to see you.

502
00:28:08,405 --> 00:28:10,710
You approached me after you found out
Ji Ni knew me, right?

503
00:28:10,712 --> 00:28:11,797
Why did you lie to me?

504
00:28:11,798 --> 00:28:13,849
I told you. Ji Ni bullied me!

505
00:28:13,851 --> 00:28:15,656
We're from completely different worlds.

506
00:28:15,658 --> 00:28:17,570
Do you really think
you can become part of our family?

507
00:28:17,572 --> 00:28:19,603
Meet the woman I want to introduce you to.

508
00:28:19,605 --> 00:28:22,065
If we look like we're dating,
you'll be protected.

509
00:28:22,066 --> 00:28:24,329
May I ask why you're going this far?

510
00:28:24,331 --> 00:28:25,712
I think I like that girl.

511
00:28:25,713 --> 00:28:27,319
Then you should confess.

512
00:28:30,141 --> 00:28:32,141
(Subtitles are provided by KOCOWA.)
